Comment: Each vendored Rust crate has its own copyright fragment in
 debian/copyright.in.d/.  Running "debian/rules debian/copyright"
 merges them (via debian/bin/merge-copyright) into this file,
 deduplicating identical license texts and renaming clashing short
 names.  The fragments were generated by the debian-copyright skill
 using an actor-critic loop (debian-copyright-writer and
 debian-copyright-reviewer agents).

